.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-config\-get \- Get configuration options
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq config get\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fINAME\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Get configuration options.
.PP
Retrieves the configuration with the given key.  Use `sq config get` to see all available options and their values.
.PP

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
 \fINAME\fR
Get the value of the configuration NAME
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
List all configuration options.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config get
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
Get the default cipher suite for key generation.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config get key.generate.cipher\-suite
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
